      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my daughter was just diagnosed with anemia and she's super tired all the time. the doctor said to start iron supplements but i was wondering if i could give her a higher dose than what's on the bottle? like maybe 325mg of elemental iron at once? i just want her to get better faster so she can get back to sports.",
