      "content": "While it seems logical to push harder when she's tired, overloading her system with excess iron is actually dangerous and can lead to iron overload, which is a serious health issue. The body absorbs iron at a specific rate, and taking too much can cause digestive problems or damage organs. Stick to the prescribed dose; your doctor is managing the process to ensure a safe and effective recovery.",
      "source": "target",
